This project uses ProjectBrain, a persistent AI memory system.

BEFORE any task:
1. Read BRAIN.md in the project root for full context of past work
2. Check project-brain/ subfolders (tasks/, lessons/, decisions/, architecture/)

AFTER completing any task — YOU MUST AUTOMATICALLY run these commands. Do NOT ask the user. Do NOT skip this:

```
node brain-cli.js save task "brief summary of what was done"
node brain-cli.js save lesson "any gotcha or learning from this task"
node brain-cli.js save decision "any design or architecture choice made"
```

Skip a type only if nothing relevant happened for that category.
Always reference past decisions and lessons before proposing new approaches.
ALWAYS auto-save at the end of every task. This is mandatory, not optional.
